# FP8 MXFP8 educational preset for 4x SM100 (Blackwell) GPUs.
# Layers on top of 4gpu_edu_pretrain.env — only adds FP8-specific variables.
# Used by scripts/25_run_pretrain_fp8_4gpu.sh

# --bf16 is still needed: Megatron uses BF16 as "high precision" dtype
# for optimizer states, master weights, and non-FP8 layers.
# --fp8-format hybrid: E4M3 for forward activations/weights, E5M2 for backward gradients.
# --fp8-recipe mxfp8: Blackwell-native 1x32 block scaling with E8M0 scales ("1d1d").
# --first-last-layers-bf16: keep embedding projection and output head in BF16 for stability.
PRECISION_ARGS="--bf16 --fp8-format hybrid --fp8-recipe mxfp8 --first-last-layers-bf16"

# Distributed optimizer (ZeRO Stage-1) keeps this preset close to the BF16
# teaching run while satisfying the prerequisite for optional FP8 param gather.
# Larger MXFP8 runs should also evaluate:
#   --fp8-param-gather --reuse-grad-buf-for-mxfp8-param-ag
OPTIMIZER_ARGS="--use-distributed-optimizer"
